OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over death in Bolton
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man in his 60s has been arrested on
OL,6,Fsuspicion of murder after a person died
OL,7,Fat a property in Bolton.
OL,9,FPolice were called to Bryngs Drive at
OL,10,F11:35 BST on Wednesday over welfare
OL,11,Fconcerns.
OL,13,FOfficers attended and found a person
OL,14,Fwho had died. No formal identification
OL,15,Fhas been made but police said they are
OL,16,Fin contact with a potential
OL,17,Fnext-of-kin.
