OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over death in Bolton
OL,4,
OL,5,FDet Ch Insp Zed Ali said officers were
OL,6,Fworking to establish "the full facts"
OL,7,Frelating to the incident, but believe
OL,8,Fboth the suspect and the victim were
OL,9,Fknown to each other.
